{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronook is a relaxing astronomy game where you return to your late grandpa\u2019s study. Take up stargazing, astrophotography and discover cosmic wonders; all with a warm beverage at hand. Your study may be small, but through your telescope, a whole new cosmos is now within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/c90ba0de9160e3241126616777708915.poster.avif?t=1763825997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/c90ba0de9160e3241126616777708915.webm?t=1763825997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/c90ba0de9160e3241126616777708915.mp4?t=1763825997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore space at your own pace from the comfort of your snug study room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Map out <strong>magical constellations</strong> in star-mapping puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Use your star chart to find and <strong>photograph a variety of charming planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2604\ufe0f Keep tabs on the latest cosmic news - who knows what <strong>celestial wonders</strong> you'll find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd2 Print your photos and fill up your <strong>stargazer\u2019s scrapbook</strong> with all your discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Experience a quiet but personal\u00a0<strong>heartfelt narrative</strong> that unfolds as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/d49876b65b0af1d6bfbd1c7a5654cdb8.poster.avif?t=1763825997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/d49876b65b0af1d6bfbd1c7a5654cdb8.webm?t=1763825997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/d49876b65b0af1d6bfbd1c7a5654cdb8.mp4?t=1763825997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503880?t=1763825997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/3735be7f40cad61cf88dee9ccc67b5b0cda1e954/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763825997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/37adf0b00611c8a819eb9536e1453dee21115c11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763825997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/37adf0b00611c8a819eb9536e1453dee21115c11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763825997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3732320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronook is a relaxing astronomy game where you return to your late grandpa\u2019s study. Take up stargazing, astrophotography and discover cosmic wonders; all with a warm beverage at hand. Your study may be small, but through your telescope, a whole new cosmos is now within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta